# Issue #102: a node removed by "~" must stay removed when it is linked
# to a replacement group: the rewired flow Group -> P3 must be dropped,
# not kept (which made Graphviz create an unlabelled P3).

process P1 Process 1
process P2 Process 2
process P3 Process 3

P1 -> P2
P1 -> P3

process Group
merge P1 P2 : Group

~ P3
